  "retained": [
    "Specialize the existing two-row GEMV and fused SwiGLU bodies for Q4_K, Q5_K and IQ4_XS. Fused specialization requires matching gate/up formats. Other formats and mixed pairs retain the existing generic body.",
    "Q5 verification batch 7 uses eight waves/four output rows; batch 8 already used this layout. Preserve bounded 32-bit indexing and wide fallbacks.",
    "IQ4_XS batch 8 uses eight waves/four rows only for the exact 17408x5120 and 5120x17408 FFN shapes.",
    "Extend the maintained projection microbenchmark with actual scalar implementation templates and fused SwiGLU controls. Use read-only host registration like production weight mapping; no production switches or additional tool executable."
  ],
